Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:24.26,Staff,,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,500)}翻譯&時軸:傻瓜三世   後期:小聖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:34.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を合わせたら　相変わらずの顔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:39.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}セーブデータは今も　あの日のまま
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}『もう戻れない』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:51.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}立ち止まってる　君の背中に　何も言えなかったりして
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.83,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}そんなんじゃないって
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:22:00.75,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}君にただ笑ってほしくて悶えてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:06.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}もう止まらない　この感情が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:12.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}嬉しい　寂しい　全てを叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:18.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}どんな想いだって　伝えてもまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:22.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}溢れてるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:28.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}未来を測れ　たった2秒だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:34.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}わずかでいい　掴み取る今
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:44.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大丈夫　何が起きても　一緒だから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:49.05,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}恐れない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:34.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}和你對上了眼 你還是當初的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:39.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}到了現在 存檔還停留在那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}「已經回不去了」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:51.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}看著你駐足的背影 我什麼都說不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不是你想的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:22:00.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我只想看到你的歡笑 所以才如此難過
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:06.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}可是心頭的感情已經難以抑制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:12.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}有欣喜 有寂寞 心聲吶喊著一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:18.56,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}無論怎樣的思念 哪怕向你傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:22.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}卻如何都傾訴不盡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:28.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}預想下未來 2秒後的樣子就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:34.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}哪怕是片刻良機 我也會抓在手心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:44.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你放心 無論發生任何事 有你的陪伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:49.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我便無所畏懼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:44.93,Title,,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(462,966)\pos(1094,686.667)}約定 -Protocol-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我好緊張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你是領隊  冷靜下來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,成年人要穩重點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你們說得簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,贏下這一場就是職業選手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,輸了就全盤皆輸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,對手還是Sleeping OWL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,無所謂  我們贏過他們一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這次無論如何都要贏下他們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也是為了美櫻!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧  瞬?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要贏下來  讓美櫻能夠走路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,說的沒錯  必須贏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,來了  請問是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,坂上小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的經紀人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  悠宇一直是我們這裡的好隊員…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要我說多少次你才懂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你不許參賽了!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是今天要決定結果了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,身份暴露的話怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我最重要的比賽!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我們走了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,請站住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不讓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.05,0:01:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,悠宇很不願意離開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我這邊是工作上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我這邊也是工作上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,少拿玩遊戲來說事!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對一步不讓!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是最後一次!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我就最後嘗試一次  求求您了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,求求您了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,坂上小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,別忘記你剛剛說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都這時候了  我還…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事  謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,之前你付出了很大努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,別放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我們能走到這裡也託了你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  要是輸了我們都是最後一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得挺好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,至少經紀人允許你參加這場比賽了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  先專注於比賽上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,贏下這場比賽  一定要打進職業聯賽!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是輸了  我就離開這個家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不會回來見你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我贏了  你就要乖乖住院!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.89,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而且要全心全意地復健!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊  瞬!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,下一場比賽由TEAM FOXONE對陣Sleeping OWL
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,關係到TEAM FOXONE能否進聯賽的最後一場比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,贏下就進聯賽  輸了就會被淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是他們不容有失的一場比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,雙方之前兩場交手都是Sleeping OWL獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,TEAM FOXONE能在這一場報仇嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,開局攻方為Sleeping OWL
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,守方為TEAM FOXONE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A點多名敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我來騷擾喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,墮貓  你別急啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,幹掉Spreader了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,發現Longshot和Heavybarrel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影在與之交戰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠得很近  包夾他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,幹掉了!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.59,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,小路有人打掉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一殺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我被幹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,FOXONE還剩一人!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,幹掉JONATHAN了  還有一人!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,反敗為勝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,又是拿其他人當誘餌的策略?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會…之前兩場他們都是正常打的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,JONATHAN啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,下一場能把指揮交給我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.21,0:04:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又想拿我們當誘餌嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是你的綠葉!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是上次我們贏了  完勝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是贏了就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以無關緊要的比賽也要打得有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧  教練?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,冠軍賽ROX的單人秀得到了運營和贊助商的好評
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是有意做就能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我們隊可以做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我們都是一流的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要把比賽變成表演不是很簡單嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他們又用同一套策略
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊  星詩流?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,別擔心  我們準備了對策
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人換用B計劃喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,避免單人行動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,以兩人小隊和三人小隊進行防守
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,既然想玩螳螂捕蟬  黃雀在後的套路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再來隻貓  專門抓你這隻黃雀不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你在說什麼嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,幹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在那邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好!  援護成功!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼  我都幹掉黃雀了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,原來還有豹子盯著貓的嗎!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我真聽不懂你在說什麼!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,被繞背了喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我們聚在一起行動被抓到漏洞了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他們從一開始就知道我們的防守弱點嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,反敗為勝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,反敗為勝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,中場休息  現在是戰術討論時間
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping OWL五局全勝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,FOXONE一定很想扭轉頹勢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,打得不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,ROX  我們能繼續這樣拿下完勝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我也同情她  但希望她能就此死心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.14,0:07:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡  為什麼都被對面算到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  根本反擊不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  每次隊員被打倒的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,都有人在可以擊殺我們的位置嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能動得那麼快!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那就說明他們預判到了我們所有動作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我說過的  我能看到未來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的戰勝不了睦生嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要我走路的話  就贏給我看!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到的話就少管閒事!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是輸了  我就離開你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續這樣贏不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要是輸了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要是贏不了的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是我的錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是我的錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想保護好她…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想跟哥哥在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟美櫻…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,會再也見不到面的!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,贏啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥  贏下來啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看來回天乏術了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,時野谷太太  我們正在重要關頭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬  出大事了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你媽媽的電話!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻  加油啊!  美櫻!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:10:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走起來了…美櫻走路了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧  美櫻?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力了…你也不許不努力!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你必須要贏…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你輸了  再也見不到面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對不接受!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對…絕對不會原諒你!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定贏  贏給你看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定凱旋回家!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬  加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽  照顧好美櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我們拼了  瞬!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,美櫻都做到了  我們怎麼可以做不到!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,已經不是說洩氣話的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,這下真的是無路可退了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有決心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼決心?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這場比賽…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打出我自己的樣子!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,這個笨丫頭!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪  那個人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,跟女演員悠好像啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是她嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可是跟電視上完全不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是她!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,悠姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎  悠宇?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,當然不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我不能一個人明哲保身
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我寧可捨棄一切也要戰鬥!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,悠宇…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思  大家都背水一戰是吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,攻守方交換
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,TEAM FOXONE主攻  繼續遊戲!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什麼計劃嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  還沒制定計劃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哎!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,無所謂  我衝鋒!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我掩護你!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,突破了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我和小瞬馬上靠過去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一個敵人  我可以!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嚐嚐黑暗的疾風喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,清除器已安放  還要堅持45秒喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,換守勢  迎擊陣型!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A點通道多名敵人!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  會被突破!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就現在  繞到背後!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,棒  指揮得好!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,曉斗  我們夾擊他們!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  別叫我真名!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,攻方獲勝!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,保住希望了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,這下沒法給人家剃光頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看來對手的行動準則變了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我援護你!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我也過來!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,按計劃D來喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,衝鋒!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,攻方獲勝!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶!  第2分!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,還有機會!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,曾經我看不到  但現在我看得到未來!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他藏在那個位置…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,說明這邊會有人!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而ROX就會藏在…那邊!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  這下有意思了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就現在!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你被打死了  笑什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到了…現在他能看到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,攻方獲勝!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,TEAM FOXONE扭轉比分!  他們步調迅猛!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好  幹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Longshot來拆彈了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我拆清除器  你們攔住敵人!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,全滅他們比較快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ROX雙殺!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping OWL也還以顏色!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,比分來到了6比6  雙方賽點!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下一局是最後一局啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  這一局分勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,下定決心上吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,自由開火!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我rush B!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,騙你們的  只是佯攻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,還是騙你們的  我這邊是主攻!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一個人  B點對了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,突擊!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,敵人過來了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太快了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你們少得意!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬  X計劃!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,衝鋒!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟著你!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我被閃了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我頂上!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,清點!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很好!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,清除器已安放
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,守住45秒!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我將回歸黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪  他在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,沒打中頭?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,沒子彈了?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要死一起死!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在那邊!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,勝利!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他們確定獨佔第6名!  打進聯賽了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶  好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶  我們成功了  瞬!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我累壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  真是艱難漫長的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我感覺這是我最快樂的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我也覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的比賽真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你可以做到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,今後我還能和變強的你繼續戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我開心極了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.41,0:20:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再見  我已經期待下一次對碰了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎來到我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  幻影忍者的真身成頭條了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:16.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\bord0\c&H000000&\3c&H5F552D&\pos(431.334,451.334)}戴面具的電競選手  真身是女演員悠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.66,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs28\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}沒想到悠是那麼粗魯的性格\N形象崩壞了\N這不是我的悠\N又不是比賽的問題  是她自己找事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,悠的粉絲也吵起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你可給我惹亂子了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,坂上小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的事讓你失去了不少粉絲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我對相關方謊稱  幻影忍者是事務所秘密進行的計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道四處解釋的我有多辛苦嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.99,0:20:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你說說接下來的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影忍者的經紀工作可以交給我們事務所嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也有不少人表示了好感
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:00.99,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs28\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}不僅可愛還有著堅定的意念  我迷上她了\N看到了悠意外的一面  真好\N反差萌\N我不認識這個人  但對她挺有好感的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我們來經營  你可以更有人氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,乾脆TEAM FOXONE的經紀工作也交給我們吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我回來了
